WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,840
If we all die

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:04,140
What's the point of living alone?

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,640
If you are the only one in the world

4
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,140
Won't you be lonely?

5
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:12,960
one day

6
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,760
You will be guilty of not reminding us

7
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,060
didn't help us

8
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,960
And fell into endless regret and self-blame

9
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,060
can you sleep at night

10
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:24,300
Don't you feel guilty?

11
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:28,940
God sooner or later

12
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:34,470
What are you anxious about?

13
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:35,870
Now is just the beginning

14
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:42,270
Even if their walls are from Tiezhu City

15
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:43,770
But what about the ceiling?

16
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:44,770
Where is the floor?

17
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:49,430
I don't believe he brought out a tin box.
